Custom Query Endpoints (Based on Method Names)
Spring Data REST exposes custom finder methods at:

/tasks/search/{methodName}

Method Name	Endpoint:

findByDescription	GET /tasks/search/findByDescription?description=Read a book
findByDescriptionContainingIgnoreCase	GET /tasks/search/findByDescriptionContainingIgnoreCase?keyword=read
findTasksWithPrefix	GET /tasks/search/findTasksWithPrefix?prefix=Read
findTasksWithDescriptionLongerThan	GET /tasks/search/findTasksWithDescriptionLongerThan?minLength=10
